eration","will","leverage","digital","technology","for","sustainability","while","minimize","their","negative","environmental","impact","equitable and meaningful inclusion","in","the digital economy","require","tackle","exist","concentration","of","technological capacity","and","market power","our cooperation","will","aim","to","ensure","that","the","benefit","of","digital cooperation","be","fairly","distribute","and","do","not","exacerbate","exist","inequality","or","impede","the full achievement","of","sustainable development","accessible","and","affordable","datum","and","digital","technology","and","service","be","essential","to","enable","every person","to","participate","fully","in","the digital world","our cooperation","will","promote","digital accessibility","for","all","and","support","linguistic and cultural diversity","in","the digital space","digital","system","that","communicate","and","exchange","be","critical","catalyst","for","development","our cooperation","will","advance","interoperability","between","digital","system","and","compatible","governance","approach","safe","secure","and","trustworthy","emerge","technology","include","artificial intelligence","offer","new","opportunity","to","turbocharge","development","our cooperation","will","advance","a","responsible","accountable","transparent","and","human","centric","approach","to","the life cycle","of","digital","and","emerge","technology","which","include","the","pre","design","design","development","evaluation","testing","deployment","use","sale","procurement","operation","and","decommissioning","stage","with","effective human oversight","creativity","and","competition","drive","digital","advance","our cooperation","will","foster","innovation","and","the potential","for","society","and","business","regardless","of","size","or","origin","to","reap","the","benefit","of","digitalization","and","thrive","in","the digital economy","government","the private sector","civil society","the technical commu