xt":"Objective 1.Close all digital divides and accelerate progress across the Sustainable Development Goals","idx":13,"match_words":["objective","close","digital","divide","accelerate","progress","the sustainable development goals"],"words":["objective","close","all","digital","divide","and","accelerate","progress","across","the sustainable development goals"],"unmatched_count":3,"match_length":7,"cut_length":10},{"key":"20","text_words":[["10","NUM",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["acknowledge","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["pivotal","ADJ",""],["role","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["universal","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["meaningful","ADJ",""],["connectivity","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["affordable","ADJ",""],["access","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["unlocking","VERB","unlock"],["the","DET",""],["full","ADJ",""],["potential","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["emerging","VERB","emerge"],["technologies","NOUN","technology"],null,["we","PRON","we"],["commit","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["connect","VERB",""],["all","DET",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["internet","PROPN",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["recognize","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["this","PRON",""],["will","AUX",""],["require","VERB",""],["strong","ADJ",""],["partnerships","NOUN","partnership"],["and","CCONJ",""],["increased","VERB","increase"],["financial","ADJ",""],["investments","NOUN","investment"],["in","ADP",""],["developing","VERB","develop"],["countries","NOUN","country"],["from","ADP",""],["governments","NOUN","government"],["and","CCONJ",""],["other","ADJ",""],["stakeholders","NOUN","stakeholder"],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["the","DET",""],["private","ADJ",""],["sector","NOUN",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["affirm","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["important","ADJ",""],["role","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["international","PROPN",""],["telecommunication","PROPN",""],["union","PROPN",""],["in","ADP",""],["advancing","VERB","advance"],["universal","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["meaningful","ADJ",""],["connectivity","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["invite","VERB",""],["it","PRON",""],["to","PART",""],["further","ADV","far"],["continue","VERB",""],["its","PRON",""],["efforts","NOUN","effort"],null,["we","PRON","we"],["recognize","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["innovative","ADJ",""],["solutions","NOUN","solution"],["can","AUX",""],["help","AUX",""],["deliver","VERB",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["speed","NOUN",""],["connectivity","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],null,["inter","PROPN",""],["alia","PROPN",""],null,["underserved","ADJ",""],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["rural","ADJ",""],["areas","NOUN","area"],null],"text":"10.We acknowledge the pivotal role of universal and meaningful connectivity and affordable access in unlocking the full potential of digital and emerging technologies.We commit to connect all persons to the Internet.We recognize that this will require strong partnerships and increased financial investments in developing countries from Governments and other stakeholders, in particular the private sector.We affirm the important role of the International Telecommunication Union in advancing universal and meaningful connectivity and invite it to further continue its efforts.We recognize that innovative solutions can help deliver high-speed connectivity to, inter alia, underserved, remote and rural areas.","idx":14,"match_words":["acknowledge","the pivotal role","universal and meaningful connectivity","affordable access","unlock","the full potential","digital","emerge","technology","commit","connect","person","the internet","recognize","require","partnership","increase","financial","investment","develop","country","government","other","stakeholder","particular","private","sector","the important role","the international telecommunication union","advance","universal and meaningful connectivity","invite","far","continue","effort","recognize","innovative","s