rvices at scale and increase social and economic opportunities for all.We recognize that there are multiple models of digital public infrastructure, and that each society will develop and use shared digital systems according to its specific priorities and needs.Transparent, safe and secure digital systems and user- centred safeguards can promote public trust and use of digital services.","idx":21,"match_words":["resilient","safe","inclusive","interoperable","digital public infrastructure","have","the potential","service","scale","increase","social","economic","opportunity","recognize","model","digital","public","infrastructure","each society","develop","use","share","digital","system","specific","priority","need","transparent","safe","secure","digital","system","centre","safeguard","promote","public trust","use","digital","service"],"words":["resilient","safe","inclusive","and","interoperable","digital public infrastructure","have","the potential","to","deliver","service","at","scale","and","increase","social","and","economic","opportunity","for","all","we","recognize","that","there","be","multiple","model","of","digital","public","infrastructure","and","that","each society","will","develop","and","use","share","digital","system","accord","to","its","specific","priority","and","need","transparent","safe","and","secure","digital","system","and","user-","centre","safeguard","can","promote","public trust","and","use","of","digital","service"],"unmatched_count":28,"match_length":39,"cut_length":67},{"key":"28","text_words":[["16","X",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["consider","VERB",""],["such","ADJ",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["public","ADJ",""],["goods","NOUN","good"],["and","CCONJ",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["public","ADJ",""],["infrastructure","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["key","ADJ",""],["drivers","NOUN","driver"],["of","ADP",""],["inclusive","ADJ",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["transformation","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["innovation","NOUN",""],null,["we"