,""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["with","ADP",""],["disabilities","NOUN","disability"],null,["sdg","NOUN","sdg"],["3","NUM",""],null,null],"text":"32.We further urgently: Call on digital technology companies and developers to engage with users of all backgrounds and abilities to incorporate their perspectives and needs into the life cycle of digital technologies (SDGs 5 and 10); Call on digital technology companies and developers to co-develop industry accountability frameworks, in consultation with Governments and other stakeholders, that increase transparency around their systems and processes, define responsibilities and commit to standards as well as auditable public reports (SDGs 9 and 17); Call on digital technology companies and social media platforms to provide online safety-related training materials and safeguards to their users, and in particular, related to children and youth users (SDG 3); Call on social media platforms to establish safe, secure and accessible reporting mechanisms for users and their advocates to report potential policy violations, including special reporting mechanisms adapted to children and persons with disabilities (SDG 3).","idx":44,"match_words":["far","urgently","call","digital","technology","company","developer","user","ability","perspective","need","the life cycle","digital","technology","sdg","call","digital","technology","company","developer","develop","industry","accountability","framework","consultation","government","other","stakeholder","increase","transparency","system","process","responsibility","commit","standard","well","public","report","sdgs","call","digital","technology","company","social","medium","platform","provide","online","safety","training","material","safeguard","user","particular","child","youth","user","sdg","call","social","medium","platform","establish","safe","secure","accessible","mechanism","user","report","potential","policy","violation","include","mechanism","adapt","child","person","disability","