VERB","respect"],["privacy","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["protection","NOUN",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["will","AUX",""],["aim","VERB",""],["for","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],["50","NUM",""],["per","NOUN",""],["cent","NOUN",""],["increase","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["available","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["monitor","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["sustainable","PROPN",""],["development","PROPN",""],["goals","PROPN",""],null,["disaggregated","VERB","disaggregate"],["by","ADP",""],["income","NOUN",""],null,["sex","NOUN",""],null,["age","NOUN",""],null,["race","NOUN",""],null,["ethnicity","NOUN",""],null,["migration","NOUN",""],["status","NOUN",""],null,["disability","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["geographical","ADJ",""],["location","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["other","ADJ",""],["characteristics","NOUN","characteristic"],["relevant","ADJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["national","ADJ",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],null,["all","DET",""],["sdgs","NOUN","sdg"],null,[";","PUNCT",""],["develop","VERB","develop"],["open","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["accessible","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["systems","NOUN","system"],["to","PART",""],["support","VERB",""],["effective","ADJ",""],["disaster","NOUN",""],["early","ADJ",""],["warning","NOUN",""],null,["early","ADJ",""],["action","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["crisis","NOUN",""],["response","NOUN",""],null,["sdgs","PROPN",""],["3","NUM",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["11","NUM",""],null,null],"text":"45.We commit, by 2030, to: Increase financing for data and statistics from all sources and enhance efforts to build capacity in data and related skills, as well as responsible data use, particularly in developing countries.We will scale up predictable financing for sustainable development data (SDG 17); Strengthen efforts to collect, analyse and disseminate relevant, accurate, reliable and disaggregated data for better monitoring and policymaking to accelerate the achievement of the 2030 Agenda, while respecting privacy and data protection.We will aim for a 50 per cent increase in the data available to monitor the Sustainable Development Goals, disaggregated by income, sex, age, race, ethnicity, migration status, disability and geographical location and other characteristics relevant in national contexts (all SDGs); Develop open and accessible data systems to support effective disaster early warning, early action and crisis response (SDGs 3 and 11).","idx":61,"match_words":["commit","increase","financing","datum","source","enhance","effort","build","capacity","datum","skill","well","responsible data use","develop","country","scale","predictable financing","sustainable","development","datum","sdg","strengthen","effort","relevant","accurate","reliable","disaggregate","datum","well","accelerate","the achievement","agenda","respect","privacy","datum","protection","aim","increase","datum","available","monitor","the sustainable development goals","disaggregate","income","age","migration status","disability","geographical location","other","relevant","national","context","sdg","develop","open","accessible","datum","system","support","effective disaster early warning","early action and crisis response","sdgs"],"words":["we","commit","by","to","increase","financing","for","datum","and","statistic","from","all","source","and","enhance","effort","to","build","capacity","in","datum","and","related","skill","as","well","as","responsible data use","particularly","in","develop","country","we","will","scale","up","predictable financing","for","sustainable","development","datum","sdg","strengthen","effort","to","collect","analyse","and","disseminate","relevant","accurate","reliable","and","disaggregate","datum","for","well","monitoring","and","policymake","to","accelerate","the achievement","of","the","agenda","while","respect","privacy","and","datum","protection","we","will","aim","for","a","per","cent","increase","in","the","datum","available","to"