nology for Development to establish a dedicated working group to engage in a comprehensive and inclusive multi-stakeholder dialogue on data governance at all levels as relevant for development.We encourage the working group to report on its progress to the General Assembly, by no later than the eighty -first session, including on follow-up recommendations towards equitable and interoperable data governance arrangements, which may include fundamental principles of data governance at all levels as relevant for development; proposals to support interoperability between national, regional and international data systems; considerations of sharing the benefits of data; and options to facilitate safe, secure and trusted data flows, including cross-border data flows as relevant for development (all SDGs).","idx":66,"match_words":["promote","support","interoperability","national","regional","international","datum","policy","framework","this context","request","the commission","science","technology","development","establish","a dedicated working group","inclusive","multi","stakeholder","dialogue","data governance","level","relevant","development","encourage","work","group","report","its progress","the general assembly","session","include","follow","recommendation","equitable","interoperable","data governance","include","fundamental","principle","data","governance","level","relevant","development","proposal","support","interoperability","national","regional","international","datum","system","consideration","share","benefit","datum","facilitate","safe","secure","trust","data","flow","include","cross","border","datum","flow","relevant","development","sdg"],"words":["we","will","promote","and","support","interoperability","between","national","regional","and","international","datum","policy","framework","in","this context","we","request","the commission","on","science","and","technology","for","development","to","establish","a dedicated working group","to","engage","in","a","comp