","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["operational","ADJ",""],["functions","NOUN","function"],null,["structure","NOUN",""],null,["location","NOUN",""],null,["mandate","NOUN",""],["renewal","NOUN",""],null,["resources","NOUN","resource"],["and","CCONJ",""],["staffing","NOUN",""],null],"text":"72.We recognize that further strengthening of system-wide coordination is required to enable the United Nations to realize the inclusive platform for digital cooperation set out in this Compact.To this end, we request the Secretary-General, following consultations with Member States, to submit a proposal to the General Assembly during its seventy-ninth session for the establishment of an office, building on and incorporating the activities and resources of the existing Office of the Secretary- General's Envoy on Technology, to facilitate system-wide coordination, working closely with existing mechanisms.This proposal should include detailed information on operational functions, structure, location, mandate renewal, resources and staffing.","idx":93,"match_words":["recognize","further strengthening","system","wide","coordination","require","enable","the united nations","the inclusive platform","digital cooperation","set","this compact","this end","request","secretary","general","follow","consultation","member states","a proposal","the general assembly","ninth","session","the establishment","an office","build","resource","exist","office","general","technology","facilitate","system","wide","coordination","work","exist","mechanism","this proposal","include","detailed information","location","mandate renewal","resource"],"words":["we","recognize","that","further strengthening","of","system","wide","coordination","be","require","to","enable","the united nations","to","realize","the inclusive platform","for","digital cooperation","set","out","in","this compact","to","this end","we","request","the","secretary","general","follow","consultation","with","member states","to","submit","a proposal","to","the general assembly","during","its","ninth","session","for","the establishment","of","an office","build","on","and","incorporate","the","activity","and","resource","of","the","exist","office","of","the","secretary-","general","'s","envoy","on","technology","to","facilitate","system","wide","coordination","work","closely","with","exist","mechanism","this proposal","should","include","detailed information","on","operational","function","structure","location","mandate renewal","resource","and","staffing"],"unmatched_count":45,"match_length":44,"cut_length":89},{"key":"103","text_words":[["73","NUM",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["recognize","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["role","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["level","NOUN",""],["political","ADJ",""],["forum","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["sustainable","ADJ",""],["development","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["economic","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["social","PROPN",""],["council","PROPN",""],["in","ADP",""],["reviewing","VERB","review"],["progress","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["compact","PROPN",""],["in","ADP",""],["closing","VERB","close"],["digital","ADJ",""],["divides","NOUN","divide"],["and","CCONJ",""],["accelerating","VERB","accelerate"],["achievement","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["2030","NUM",""],["agenda","PROPN",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["recognize","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["role","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["human","PROPN",""],["rights","PROPN",""],["council","PROPN",""],null,["within","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["existing","VERB","exist"],["mandate","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["fostering","VERB","foster"],["an","DET",""],["inclusive","ADJ",""],null,["open","ADJ",""],null,["safe","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["secure","VERB",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["space","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["all","PRON",""],null],"text":"73.We recognize the role of the high-level political forum on sustainable development and the Economic and Social Council in reviewing progress of the Compact in closing digital divides and accelerating achievement of the 2030 Agenda.We recognize the role of the Human Rights Council, within its existing mandate, in fostering an inclusive, open, safe and secure digital space for all.","idx":94,"match_words":["recognize","the role","high","level","forum","sustainable development","the economic and social council","review","progress","the compact","close","digital","divide","accelerate","achievement","agenda","recognize","the role","the human rights council","exist","mandate","foster","inclusive","open","safe","secure","digital space"],"words":["we","recognize","the role","of","the","high","level","political","forum","on","sustainable development","and","the economic and social council","in","review","progress","of","the compact","in","close","digital","divide","and","accelerate","achievement","of","the","agenda","we","recognize","the role","of","the human rights council","within","its","exist","mandate","in","foster","an","inclusive","open","safe","and","secure","digital space","for","all"],"unmatched_count":21,"match_length":27,"cut_length":48},{"key":"104","text_words":[["74","NUM",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["cross","ADJ",""],null,["cutting","VERB","cut"],["nature","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["technologies","NOUN","technology"],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["multiplicity","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["actors","NOUN","actor"],["involved","VERB","involve"],["in","ADP",""],["digital","ADJ",""],["cooperation","NOUN",""],["require","VERB",""],["synergies","NOUN","synergy"],["and","CCONJ",""],["aligned","VERB","align"],["follow","NOUN",""],null,["up","NOUN",""],null,["we","PRON","we"],["commit","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["review","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["compact","PROPN",""],["to","PART",""],["assess","VERB",""],["progress","NOUN",""],["against","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["objectives","NOUN","objective"],["and"