","digital cooperation","require","follow","commit","review","the compact","assess","progress","objective","identify","emerge","opportunity","challenge","global digital cooperation","high","level","meeting","high","level","review","the global digital compact","take","place","session","the general assembly","base","a progress report","secretary","general","the input and meaningful participation","stakeholder","include","the commission","science","technology","development","the internet governance forum","world summit","information","society","action","line","facilitator","request","the president","the general assembly","facilitator","develop","country","develop","country","session","facilitate","open","transparent","inclusive","consultation","modality","high","level","meeting"],"words":["the","cross","cut","nature","of","digital","technology","and","the multiplicity","of","actor","involve","in","digital cooperation","require","synergy","and","align","follow","up","we","commit","to","review","the compact","to","assess","progress","against","its","objective","and","to","identify","emerge","opportunity","and","challenge","for","global digital cooperation","we","decide","to","convene","a","high","level","meeting","entitle","high","level","review","of","the global digital compact","to","take","place","during","the","second","session","of","the general assembly","base","on","a progress report","by","the","secretary","general","and","with","the input and meaningful participation","of","all","stakeholder","include","the commission","on","science","and","technology","for","development","the internet governance forum","and","world summit","on","the","information","society","action","line","facilitator","we","request","the president","of","the general assembly","to","appoint","co","facilitator","from","a","develop","country","and","from","a","develop","country","at","the","first","session","to","facilitate","open","transparent","and","inclusive","intergovernmental","consultatio